  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A halfling thief-acrobat in leather armour, eighty-eight years old, four foot eight, blond, blue-eyed, upper class, and (Comeliness 18) the handsomest halfling anyone has ever seen. Always slightly higher up than everyone else: on the bar, on a rafter, on someone's shoulders. His deity is his dagger, and his holy symbol is a silver dagger. His secondary skill is carpet making; he will tell you about it. On the sheet, next to <em>Jewelry</em>, it says <em>I hope so</em>.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
    "public": ""
   },
   "alignment": "Neutral Evil",
