     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>A ring of invisibility (he turns invisible as an action until he attacks, once per round of his choosing) and a ring of chameleon power (Advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks; he blends into any crowd, booth or bookshelf). His ring of protection +3 is already in his AC.</p>",
