     "spent": 0,
     "recovery": [],
     "max": ""
    },
    "description": {
     "value": "<p>He carries a leather bag with a sapphire in it worth eleven thousand eight hundred gold pieces, and the sapphire has a demon in it. He will not open the bag and does not like it being touched. Nobody at the table remembers what happens if it is opened, so nothing does, unless you want it to.</p>",
     "chat": ""
